    "description": "Rarely Available New Construction in Noe Valley! This brand new, never lived in, 3-bed/3-bath single-family alternative offers boutique luxury in one of San Francisco's most desirable neighborhoods. The modern floor plan features floor-to-ceiling sliding doors that provide direct, walk-out access from the open-plan kitchen/living/dining area to a private rear yard. Complete with outdoor kitchen, landscaping & lighting, indoor/outdoor living is elevated to the next level. Overlooking the yard, the spacious primary suite boasts a spa-like bathroom with a dual sink vanity, rain showerhead in a large walk-in shower, and huge closet. The second bedroom also includes an ensuite, full bath with shower-over-tub configuration. A flex room and full bath off the living area provide additional space for guests or a home office. Now 50% Sold Out! Discerning buyers can choose from a collection of distinctive new construction condominium homes, each outfitted with high-end European appliances and premium amenities and finishes. In-unit laundry room and parking are included. Prime Location - Walk Score of 99! A 2-bedroom unit is also available, featuring a roof deck, outdoor kitchen, and more. Don't miss this opportunity to own a piece of luxury in Noe Valley. Schedule a showing today!"
  },
